 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "KeyValueStore() starts empty. set(key, value) stores or overwrites; get(key) returns the value or \"\" when absent; unset(key) removes the key (no effect when absent). begin() opens a nested transaction. rollback() undoes every change made since the innermost open begin and closes it, returning true, or returns false when no transaction is open. commit() makes all changes permanent and closes every open transaction, returning true, or false when none is open. count(value) returns how many keys currently hold value. Values are non-empty. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-a-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
